17837cac-000d-476d-84f7-946a6600b869/9742-0
01:05:11.120 --> 01:05:12.720
<v Martina Medlenov&#225;>Jo jestli ke to dostanu?</v>

17837cac-000d-476d-84f7-946a6600b869/9744-0
01:05:11.501 --> 01:05:11.821
Jaroslav.

17837cac-000d-476d-84f7-946a6600b869/9767-0
01:05:12.271 --> 01:05:16.560
<v @2>Jako jestli to jestli to jestli to
